  "releaseNotes": "## v3.18.13 (patch)\n\nChanges since v3.18.12:\n\n- fix: leave out a braced-list member initialiser that has no value [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: write a C# const local only for a compile-time value [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: build a write-only Python property from its setter alone [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
